message: "If you use cellpacman, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cellpacman: PAinted Cell and coMpound ANalysis (PACMAN) - concentration trajectories for Cell Painting screens"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: MIT
